# Hy4-flash's placed prompt pass streaming host experts to the card (R5: the common PromptStream/StreamSide over a walk of
# eight 512-row units, ring half 220 slots, 2.13 GB; xsplit's ring tail by the balance) against the unstreamed pass
# (main at 33f9d22a5, measured pp4096 334.55, pp512 331.91, decode @512 34.40 on this card). The effect [derived,
# specs/day1117/hy4/hy4r5s-report.md: the host union refit from the measured pass, c 5.10-5.38 us/col, a 6.34-7.92 us,
# m* 32-45 columns]: at P = 4096 the walk's units stream the experts routed past the balance, 272-283 -> 115-137 ms a
